        <section>
            <h2>1. Identity Without a Trace (The 12-Word Vault)</h2>
            <p><b>The Advantage:</b> Unlike Signal, Telegram, or WhatsApp, I require zero personal data.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><span class="highlight">No Phone Numbers:</span> No SIM cards, no SMS verification, no "Phone Number Leaks."</li>
